                "text": "Rural communities in Wisconsin have fewer healthcare facilities and patients have longer travel times to see a doctor. The Rural Health Transformation Program is a historic opportunity to reverse this trend and deliver real solutions for patients and small-town hospitals across our state. @GovEvers must act quickly and take advantage of this historic opportunity for Wisconsin.\n\nRead our letter \u2b07\ufe0f",
