                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I agree with @POTUS we need to put individuals back in control of their own healthcare. HSAs and HRAs are proven solutions to the problems caused by Obamacare. HRAs let employers set aside tax-free dollars for employees to use on medical expenses. They also give employees the ability to choose the health plan that works best for them instead of being forced to a single employer-sponsored option.",
